      "message": "I downloaded the CL to verify, and can confirm that the local matrix tests that I\u0027m aware of no longer work right:\n- GM_local_matrix_shader_rt (bottom two images aren\u0027t rotated)\n- GM_localmatrixshader_nested (not sure what is going on here, images are almost completely missing)\n\nIf fixing this would be difficult or would bloat the CL a lot, we can defer it, but I honestly expect it should be a pretty small change. I would be happy to help with it if we want to get everything landed and working sooner.",
